@startuml
title ai_help — sequence
actor "learner" as U
participant "web_app" as S_0
participant "openrouter" as S_1
== connect_ai (onboard) ==
U -> S_0 : ai_consent, openrouter_auth
U -> S_1 : ai_consent, openrouter_auth
note right of U : emotion 3/5 — pain: 何が外部へ送られるのか不安, 鍵がどこに保存されるのか不安
== ask (use) ==
U -> S_0 : ai_context_preview, ai_chat
U -> S_1 : ai_context_preview, ai_chat
note right of U : emotion 4/5
== review_change (use) ==
U -> S_0 : ai_diff
note right of U : emotion 4/5 — pain: 提案が複数ファイルにまたがると全体が見えない
== disconnect (exit) ==
U -> S_0 : ai_disconnect
note right of U : emotion 4/5
@enduml
